### ─── 🔐 AUTH: Registro, Login, Refresh, Logout ────────────────────────
### Variables del entorno: http-client.env.json
### Las cookies HttpOnly se persisten automáticamente en REST Client.
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/health
Accept: application/json


### ─── LOGIN (usuarios del seed, no requiere register) ─────────────────

### Login como Admin
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{AdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{DefaultPassword}}"
}


### Login como Instructor
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{InstructorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{DefaultPassword}}"
}


### Login como Moderator
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{ModeratorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{DefaultPassword}}"
}


### Login como Student
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{StudentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{DefaultPassword}}"
}


### ─── REGISTER (solo si necesitás usuarios extra) ───────────────────

### Register como Admin
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo Admin",
  "email": "nuevo-admin@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "Admin"
}


### Register como Instructor
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo Instructor",
  "email": "nuevo-instructor@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "Instructor"
}


### Register como Moderator
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo Moderator",
  "email": "nuevo-moderator@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "Moderator"
}


### Register como Student (role por defecto)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nuevo Student",
  "email": "nuevo-student@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ─── REFRESH ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Refrescar tokens (lee refreshToken de cookie o del body)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "pegar-acá-el-token"
}


### ─── LOGOUT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Cerrar sesión
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ─── EMAIL VERIFICATION ────────────────────────────────────────────

### Verificar email con código
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "usuario@test.com",
  "code": "ABC123"
}


### Reenviar código de verificación
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@test.com"
}


### ─── PASSWORD RESET ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Solicitar reset de password (envía código al email)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@test.com"
}


### Resetear password con código
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@test.com",
  "code": "ABC123",
  "newPassword": "NuevaPassword123!"
}
